*> Nadaraya-Watson kernel regression of petal length on petal width (iris), with the
*> bandwidth chosen by leave-one-out CV, compared against a too-small and a too-large one.
*> Run with `just run-cobol TARGET=kernel_regression_iris_ex`.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. KERNEL-REGRESSION-IRIS-EX.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
COPY "datamunge.cpy".

78 FORMULA VALUE "Petal.Length ~ Petal.Width".

01 IRIS      USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 MODEL     USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 SMALL     USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 LARGE     USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 FIT-MODEL USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 PLOT      USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 PLOT-PATH PIC X(64).
01 NUM-EDIT   PIC Z(8)9.
01 NUM-EDIT-2 PIC Z(8)9.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    CALL "dm_data_frame_iris" USING DM-DATA-FRAME-IRIS DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-DATA-FRAME-IRIS-RESULT TO IRIS
    MOVE IRIS TO DM-DATA-FRAME-NROWS-SELF
    CALL "dm_data_frame_nrows" USING DM-DATA-FRAME-NROWS DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE IRIS TO DM-DATA-FRAME-NCOLS-SELF
    CALL "dm_data_frame_ncols" USING DM-DATA-FRAME-NCOLS DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-DATA-FRAME-NROWS-RESULT TO NUM-EDIT
    MOVE DM-DATA-FRAME-NCOLS-RESULT TO NUM-EDIT-2
    DISPLAY "iris: " FUNCTION TRIM(NUM-EDIT) " rows x " FUNCTION TRIM(NUM-EDIT-2) " cols"
    DISPLAY "formula: " FORMULA
    DISPLAY " "

    *> Bandwidth auto-selected via leave-one-out CV.
    MOVE IRIS TO DM-KERNEL-REGRESSION-NEW-DATA
    MOVE FORMULA TO DM-KERNEL-REGRESSION-NEW-FORMULA
    CALL "dm_kernel_regression_new" USING DM-KERNEL-REGRESSION-NEW DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-KERNEL-REGRESSION-NEW-RESULT TO MODEL
    MOVE MODEL TO DM-KERNEL-REGRESSION-PRINT-SUMMARY-SELF
    CALL "dm_kernel_regression_print_summary" USING DM-KERNEL-REGRESSION-PRINT-SUMMARY DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK

    MOVE MODEL TO FIT-MODEL
    MOVE "kernel_regression_iris_fit.svg" TO PLOT-PATH
    PERFORM SAVE-FIT-PLOT
    MOVE MODEL TO DM-KERNEL-REGRESSION-PLOT-CV-CURVE-SELF
    CALL "dm_kernel_regression_plot_cv_curve" USING DM-KERNEL-REGRESSION-PLOT-CV-CURVE DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-KERNEL-REGRESSION-PLOT-CV-CURVE-RESULT TO PLOT
    MOVE "kernel_regression_iris_cv.svg" TO PLOT-PATH
    PERFORM SAVE-PLOT
    DISPLAY " "
    DISPLAY "Saved kernel_regression_iris_fit.svg and kernel_regression_iris_cv.svg"

    *> A too-small and a too-large bandwidth, for comparison: the classic kernel
    *> regression bias-variance story. Arguments: data, formula, kernel, bandwidth, ...
    MOVE 4 TO DM-KERNEL-REGRESSION-NEW-GIVEN
    MOVE "gaussian" TO DM-KERNEL-REGRESSION-NEW-KERNEL
    MOVE 0.05 TO DM-KERNEL-REGRESSION-NEW-BANDWIDTH
    CALL "dm_kernel_regression_new" USING DM-KERNEL-REGRESSION-NEW DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-KERNEL-REGRESSION-NEW-RESULT TO SMALL
    MOVE SMALL TO FIT-MODEL
    PERFORM FIT-STATS
    DISPLAY " "
    DISPLAY "bandwidth=0.05 (too small): LOO R-squared=" DM-KERNEL-REGRESSION-R-SQUARED-RESULT
        "  LOO RMSE=" DM-KERNEL-REGRESSION-RMSE-RESULT
    MOVE "kernel_regression_iris_fit_small_bandwidth.svg" TO PLOT-PATH
    PERFORM SAVE-FIT-PLOT

    MOVE 5.0 TO DM-KERNEL-REGRESSION-NEW-BANDWIDTH
    CALL "dm_kernel_regression_new" USING DM-KERNEL-REGRESSION-NEW DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-KERNEL-REGRESSION-NEW-RESULT TO LARGE
    MOVE LARGE TO FIT-MODEL
    PERFORM FIT-STATS
    DISPLAY "bandwidth=5.0 (too large):  LOO R-squared=" DM-KERNEL-REGRESSION-R-SQUARED-RESULT
        "  LOO RMSE=" DM-KERNEL-REGRESSION-RMSE-RESULT
    MOVE "kernel_regression_iris_fit_large_bandwidth.svg" TO PLOT-PATH
    PERFORM SAVE-FIT-PLOT

    MOVE MODEL TO FIT-MODEL
    PERFORM FIT-STATS
    MOVE MODEL TO DM-KERNEL-REGRESSION-BANDWIDTH-SELF
    CALL "dm_kernel_regression_bandwidth" USING DM-KERNEL-REGRESSION-BANDWIDTH DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    DISPLAY "bandwidth=" DM-KERNEL-REGRESSION-BANDWIDTH-RESULT " (CV-selected): LOO R-squared="
        DM-KERNEL-REGRESSION-R-SQUARED-RESULT "  LOO RMSE=" DM-KERNEL-REGRESSION-RMSE-RESULT
    DISPLAY " "
    DISPLAY "Saved kernel_regression_iris_fit_small_bandwidth.svg and "
        "kernel_regression_iris_fit_large_bandwidth.svg"

    MOVE LARGE TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS
    MOVE SMALL TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS
    MOVE MODEL TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS
    MOVE IRIS TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS
    STOP RUN.

*> Reads FIT-MODEL's leave-one-out R-squared and RMSE into the result fields.
FIT-STATS.
    MOVE FIT-MODEL TO DM-KERNEL-REGRESSION-R-SQUARED-SELF
    CALL "dm_kernel_regression_r_squared" USING DM-KERNEL-REGRESSION-R-SQUARED DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE FIT-MODEL TO DM-KERNEL-REGRESSION-RMSE-SELF
    CALL "dm_kernel_regression_rmse" USING DM-KERNEL-REGRESSION-RMSE DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK.

*> Saves FIT-MODEL's fit over the iris data to PLOT-PATH.
SAVE-FIT-PLOT.
    MOVE FIT-MODEL TO DM-KERNEL-REGRESSION-PLOT-FIT-SELF
    MOVE IRIS TO DM-KERNEL-REGRESSION-PLOT-FIT-DATA
    CALL "dm_kernel_regression_plot_fit" USING DM-KERNEL-REGRESSION-PLOT-FIT DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-KERNEL-REGRESSION-PLOT-FIT-RESULT TO PLOT
    PERFORM SAVE-PLOT.

*> Saves PLOT to PLOT-PATH and closes it.
SAVE-PLOT.
    MOVE PLOT TO DM-PLOT-SAVE-SELF
    MOVE PLOT-PATH TO DM-PLOT-SAVE-PATH
    CALL "dm_plot_save" USING DM-PLOT-SAVE DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE PLOT TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS.

*> Stops with the error after a failed call.
CHECK.
    IF NOT DM-STATUS-OK
        DISPLAY "datamunge error (" FUNCTION TRIM(DM-STATUS-KIND) "): "
            DM-STATUS-MESSAGE(1:DM-STATUS-LENGTH) UPON SYSERR
        STOP RUN RETURNING 1
    END-IF.
